156
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:14,050
Sure! Where do you want to go?

157
00:12:14,050 --> 00:12:16,550
How about the new café near the station?

158
00:12:16,550 --> 00:12:19,030
Sounds good. See you at the gate!

159
00:12:19,430 --> 00:12:23,460
이제 따라 해 볼까요? 먼저 천천히 들어 보세요.

160
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:25,600
Do you want to grab lunch?

161
